[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Wikidata matches of the drowned villages\n\nInspects the output of the `wikidata` step: which backbone villages got a Wikidata item, how reliable that match is, and what Wikidata knows that the backbone doesn't.\n\n**Before running:** `pnpm --filter @verdronkendorpen/exploration run fetch:backbone` and `fetch:wikidata`. Every cell queries three files:\n\n- `data/wikidata/matches.ttl`: every `vd:Candidate` (`vd:village`, `vd:record` = the item, `vd:matchedBy`, `vd:nameOrigin`, `vd:status`, `vd:statusReason`, `vd:distanceKm`, `vd:classRank`), and each village's overall `vd:matchStatus`.\n- `data/wikidata/villages.ttl`: the Wikidata items (labels, classes, coordinates, nlwiki article, image, Commons category, Rijksmonument number).\n- `data/backbone/villages.ttl`: the backbone villages (label, alternative names, municipality, coordinates, date of drowning).\n\nStatuses, reasons and match keys are concepts in `vocab/vd.ttl` (`vd:status-accepted`, `vd:reason-tie`, `vd:key-place-geo`, ...). Village statuses: `matched` (one accepted item), `ambiguous` (a tie), `unconfirmed` (candidates, but none accepted) and `not-found`. See the SOP for the matching rules.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Overview",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?status (COUNT(?village) AS ?villages) WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus ?statusConcept .\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?statusConcept), \"#village-\") AS ?status)\n}\nGROUP BY ?status\nORDER BY DESC(?villages)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "All candidates by status and reason.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?status ?reason (COUNT(?candidate) AS ?candidates) WHERE {\n  ?candidate a vd:Candidate ;\n    vd:status ?statusConcept .\n  OPTIONAL { ?candidate vd:statusReason ?reasonConcept }\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?statusConcept), \"#status-\") AS ?status)\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?reasonConcept), \"#reason-\") AS ?reason)\n}\nGROUP BY ?status ?reason\nORDER BY ?status DESC(?candidates)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Good matches\n\nVillages with an accepted item, with the item's class, distance to the backbone point, the match key and where the matching name comes from. `submerged settlement` (verdronken plaats) as class and a small distance make a reliable match.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?distanceKm ?matchedBy ?nameOrigin (GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT ?classLabel; separator=\", \") AS ?classes) (SAMPLE(?article) AS ?nlwiki) WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:village ?village ;\n    vd:record ?item ;\n    vd:status vd:status-accepted ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?key ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n  OPTIONAL { ?candidate vd:nameOrigin ?origin }\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name .\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?key), \"#key-\") AS ?matchedBy)\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?origin), \"#origin-\") AS ?nameOrigin)\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P31/rdfs:label ?classLabel }\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?distanceKm ?matchedBy ?nameOrigin\nORDER BY ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "How strong the accepted matches are: by the best class of the item (0 = submerged settlement, 1 = former settlement or ghost town, 2 = human settlement, 3 = other) and by name origin.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?classRank ?nameOrigin (COUNT(?candidate) AS ?villages) (ROUND(AVG(?distanceKm) * 100) / 100 AS ?avgDistanceKm) WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:status vd:status-accepted ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n  OPTIONAL { ?candidate vd:nameOrigin ?origin }\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?origin), \"#origin-\") AS ?nameOrigin)\n}\nGROUP BY ?classRank ?nameOrigin\nORDER BY ?classRank ?nameOrigin",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Accepted matches worth a second look: the item is not a submerged or former settlement, or lies more than 2 km from the backbone point.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?classRank ?distanceKm WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:village ?village ;\n    vd:record ?item ;\n    vd:status vd:status-accepted ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name .\n  FILTER(?classRank > 1 || ?distanceKm > 2)\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?classRank ?distanceKm\nORDER BY DESC(?distanceKm)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## What the matches bring\n\nHow many accepted items have an nlwiki article, an image, a Commons category, a Rijksmonument number, or a date of founding or disappearance on Wikidata.\n\nSome backbone entries share one item (for example the locations of Saeftinghe), so there are fewer items than matched villages. Variables bound inside an `OPTIONAL` only see that group, so the counts bind `?item`, which occurs in each group.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?item) AS ?matched) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withArticle) AS ?nlwiki) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withImage) AS ?image) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withCommons) AS ?commonsCategory) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withMonument) AS ?rijksmonument) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withDates) AS ?dates) WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:record ?item ;\n    vd:status vd:status-accepted .\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item . BIND(?item AS ?withArticle) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P18 ?image . BIND(?item AS ?withImage) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P373 ?commons . BIND(?item AS ?withCommons) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P359 ?monument . BIND(?item AS ?withMonument) }\n  OPTIONAL { { ?item wdt:P571 ?date } UNION { ?item wdt:P576 ?date } BIND(?item AS ?withDates) }\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Per village: what the accepted item adds, next to the date of drowning from the Wikipedia list (backbone). `dissolved` (P576) on Wikidata can be compared with `drownedEndYear`.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item ?drownedEndYear ?dissolved ?inception ?image ?commonsCategory ?rijksmonument WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:village ?village ;\n    vd:record ?item ;\n    vd:status vd:status-accepted .\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name .\n  OPTIONAL { ?village vd:drownedEndYear ?drownedEndYear }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P18 ?image }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P373 ?commonsCategory }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P359 ?rijksmonument }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P571 ?inception }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P576 ?dissolved }\n}\nORDER BY ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Open cases\n\nCandidates to review, with the reason: `tie` (equally strong items), `no-coordinates`, `alt-name` (only an alternative name matched a present-day place) and `weak-key` (a nearby drowned place without a matching name, which may be the same village under another name). Accept or reject them in `exploration/resources/match-overrides.json`.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?reason ?matchedBy ?classRank ?distanceKm WHERE {\n  ?candidate vd:village ?village ;\n    vd:record ?item ;\n    vd:status vd:status-review ;\n    vd:statusReason ?reasonConcept ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?key ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank .\n  OPTIONAL { ?candidate vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm }\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name .\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?reasonConcept), \"#reason-\") AS ?reason)\n  BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?key), \"#key-\") AS ?matchedBy)\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?reason ?matchedBy ?classRank ?distanceKm\nORDER BY ?reason ?name ?distanceKm",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Villages without any candidate.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?municipality (GROUP_CONCAT(?altName; separator=\", \") AS ?altNames) WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus vd:village-not-found ;\n    rdfs:label ?name .\n  OPTIONAL { ?village vd:municipality ?municipality }\n  OPTIONAL { ?village skos:altLabel ?altName }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?municipality\nORDER BY ?municipality ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Wikidata only\n\nSubmerged settlements in the Netherlands on Wikidata that no backbone village is matched to, with the backbone villages that list it as a candidate (if any). Many of these lie outside Zeeland (the query covers all of the Netherlands), so check the coordinates.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/backbone/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) (SAMPLE(?coord) AS ?coordinates) (SAMPLE(?article) AS ?nlwiki) (GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT ?nearby; separator=\", \") AS ?candidateFor) WHERE {\n  ?item wdt:P31 wd:Q20616831 .\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?accepted vd:record ?item ; vd:status vd:status-accepted }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P625 ?coord }\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item }\n  OPTIONAL {\n    ?candidate vd:record ?item ;\n      vd:village ?village .\n    ?village rdfs:label ?nearby .\n  }\n}\nGROUP BY ?item\nORDER BY ?label",
    "metadata": {}
  }
]
